  "notes": "<p>This show was night two of Phish&#39;s Baker&#39;s Dozen run at Madison Square Garden and consisted of a Strawberry donut theme. Strawberry donuts were given to fans arriving at the venue and the show featured the Phish debuts of&nbsp;Strawberry Fields Forever and Strawberry Letter 23. Moma Dance was unfinished.&nbsp;Trey teased Pictures of Matchstick Men in the first DWD. I Always&nbsp;Wanted It This Way featured Trey on the Marimba Lumina.&nbsp;All of These Dreams was last played on October 26, 2010&nbsp;(251 shows). Mike teased Dave&#39;s Energy Guide in Split Open and&nbsp;Melt.</p>",
